images.caption:
View of the U.S. Navy Puget Sound Naval Shipyard in early 1956. Visible are (partly):
the heavy cruiser USS Baltimore (CA-68), decommissioned on 31 May 1956;
the light aircraft carrier USS Wright (CVL-49), decommissioned on 15 March 1956;

the aircraft carrier USS Midway (CVA-41), SCB-110 modernisation at Puget Sound from August 1955 to September 1957.

